"Blog | Qwen (https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/)\nciteturn1937view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 37\nL0: ## We have a new blog at cite0†qwen.ai†qwen.ai !\nL1: \nL2: This page will automatically redirect in 5 seconds.\nL3: \nL4: If you are not redirected automatically, please click the button below.\nL5: \nL6: [Button: Go Now]\nL7: \nL8:   * cite1†Blog L9:   * cite2†Publication L10:   * cite3†About L11:   * cite4†Try Qwen Chat †chat.qwen.ai L12: \nL13: # Blog^{  [\nL14: \nL15:   * cite5†简体中文 L16: ]}\nL17: ## Qwen3Guard: Real-time Safety for Your Token Stream\nL18: Tech Report GitHub Hugging Face ModelScope DISCORD Introduction We are excited to introduce Qwen3Guard, the first safety guardrail model in the Qwen family. Built upon the powerful Qwen3 foundation models and fine-tuned specifically for safety classificatoin, Qwen3Guard ensures responsible AI interactions by delivering precise safety detection for both prompts and responses, complete with risk levels and categorized classifications for accurate moderation.\nL19: Qwen3Guard achieves state-of-the-art performance on major safety benchmarks, demonstrating strong capabilities in both prompt and response classification tasks across English, Chinese, and multilingual environments....\nL20: September 23, 2025 · 7 min · 1470 words · Qwen Team\nL21: ## Qwen-Image-Edit: Image Editing with Higher Quality and Efficiency\nL22: QWEN CHAT GITHUB HUGGING FACE MODELSCOPE DISCORD We are excited to introduce Qwen-Image-Edit, the image editing version of Qwen-Image. Built upon our 20B Qwen-Image model, Qwen-Image-Edit successfully extends Qwen-Image’s unique text rendering capabilities to image editing tasks, enabling precise text editing.\nL23: Furthermore, Qwen-Image-Edit simultaneously feeds the input image into Qwen2.5-VL (for visual semantic control) and the VAE Encoder (for visual appearance control), achieving capabilities in both semantic and appearance editing....\nL24: August 19, 2025 · 4 min · 824 words · Qwen Team\nL25: ## Qwen-Image: Crafting with Native Text Rendering\nL26: GITHUB HUGGING FACE MODELSCOPE DEMO DISCORD We are thrilled to release Qwen-Image, a 20B MMDiT image foundation model that achieves significant advances in complex text rendering and precise image editing. To try the latest model, feel free to visit Qwen Chat and choose “Image Generation”. The key features include: Superior Text Rendering: Qwen-Image excels at complex text rendering, including multi-line layouts, paragraph-level semantics, and fine-grained details.\nL27: It supports both alphabetic languages (e....\nL28: August 4, 2025 · 6 min · 1229 words · Qwen Team\nL29: ## GSPO: Towards Scalable Reinforcement Learning for Language Models\nL30: PAPER DISCORD Introduction Reinforcement Learning (RL) has emerged as a pivotal paradigm for scaling language models and enhancing their deep reasoning and problem-solving capabilities. To scale RL, the foremost prerequisite is maintaining stable and robust training dynamics. However, we observe that existing RL algorithms (such as GRPO) exhibit severe instability issues during long training and lead to irreversible model collapse, hindering further performance improvements with increased compute.\nL31: To enable successful RL scaling, we propose the Group Sequence Policy Optimization (GSPO) algorithm....\nL32: July 27, 2025 · 5 min · 916 words · Qwen Team\nL33: ## Qwen-MT: Where Speed Meets Smart Translation\nL34: DEMO API DISCORD Introduction Here we introduce the latest update of Qwen-MT (qwen-mt-turbo) via Qwen API. This update builds upon the powerful Qwen3, leveraging trillions multilingual and translation tokens to comprehensively enhance the model’s multilingual understanding and translation capabilities. By integrating reinforcement learning techniques, the model achieves significant improvements in translation accuracy and linguistic fluency.\nL35: Key Features: Multilingual Support for 92 Languages: Qwen-MT enables high-quality translation across 92 major official languages and prominent dialects, covering over 95% of the global population to meet diverse cross-lingual communication needs....\nL36: July 24, 2025 · 6 min · 1220 words · Qwen Teamcite6†Next  » © 2026 cite7†Qwen Powered by cite8†Hugo†gohugo.io --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nERNIE Blog (https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/zh/)\nciteturn1937view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/zh/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 68\nL0:   * cite0†论文 L1:   * cite1†关于 L2:   * cite2†文心助手†wenxin.baidu.com L3: \nL4:     * cite3†EN L5: \nL6: # ERNIE Blog\nL7: \nL8: Welcome to ERNIE Blog!\nL9: \nL10: ## 文心 5.1 正式发布！多榜登顶，模型\"写得好更懂你\"\nL11: \nL12: 文心 5.1 正式上线，仅使用业界同规模模型约 6% 的预训练成本实现同级别效果领先。通过分离式全异步强化学习与规模化智能体后训练，在 Agent、推理、创作等多维度能力全面升级，Arena 搜索榜国内第一。\nL13: \nL14: 2026年5月9日 · 2 分钟\nL15: \nL16: ## 文心大模型5.1 Preview 荣登 LMArena 文本榜国内第一！\nL17: \nL18: 4 月 30 日，大模型竞技场 LMArena 公布最新排名，文心大模型 ERNIE-5.1-Preview 荣登 LMArena 文本榜国内第一、全球第十三，并在法律与政府、商业管理金融、软件与IT服务等多个垂类领域取得全球前十成绩。\nL19: \nL20: 2026年4月30日 · 1 分钟\nL21: ## ERNIE-Image 文生图模型发布\nL22: \nL23: ERNIE-Image 是基于 8B DiT 参数的单流扩散 Transformer 文生图模型，在多项基准测试中达到开源模型领先水平。\nL24: \nL25: 2026年4月15日 · 1 分钟\nL26: \nL27: ## 文心 5.0 (ERNIE 5.0)：2.4 万亿参数的原生全模态大模型\nL28: \nL29: 本文正式介绍文心新一代模型文心 5.0 (ERNIE 5.0)——一款 2.4 万亿参数的原生全模态大模型。采用原生的全模态统一建模技术，将文本、图像、音频、视频联合建模，具备综合的全模态能力，突破了传统后融合架构的局限。\nL30: \nL31: 2026年2月6日 · 1 分钟\nL32: \nL33: ## PaddleOCR-VL-1.5：面向真实场景文档解析的多任务 0.9B 视觉语言模型\nL34: \nL35: 🚀 我们发布了全新升级的模型 PaddleOCR-VL-1.5，在 OmniDocBench v1.5 上取得 94.5% 的全新 SOTA 准确率。\nL36: \nL37: 2026年1月29日 · 3 分钟\nL38: ## ERNIE-5.0 荣登 LMArena 文本榜国内第一，全面超越多款国际主流模型！\nL39: \nL40: 1 月 15 日，大模型竞技场 LMArena 公布最新排名，文心大模型 ERNIE-5.0-0110 以 1460 分 的成绩，登上 LMArena 文本排行榜国内第一、全球第八。\nL41: \nL42: 2026年1月15日 · 1 分钟\nL43: \nL44: ## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1220 荣登 LMArena 视觉理解榜，为前十唯一国产模型！\nL45: \nL46: 1 月 8 日，全球权威大模型评测平台 LMArena 公布最新排名，文心大模型 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1220 以 1226 分的成绩，登上 LMArena 视觉理解榜（Vision Arena）中国第一，全球第八。\nL47: \nL48: 2026年1月8日 · 1 分钟\nL49: \nL50: ## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1203 位居 LMArena 中国文本模型榜首！\nL51: \nL52: 刚刚，国际知名大模型评测平台 LMArena 发布最新榜单，百度 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1203 获得 1451 分，并在复杂提示、创意写作等多个关键维度展现领先实力。\nL53: \nL54: 2025年12月23日 · 1 分钟\nL55: ## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1103 登陆 LMArena 文本榜单！\nL56: \nL57: 刚刚，文心大模型最新版 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1103 刷新了排名。该版本在竞争 Text Arena 中位居前20 名。\nL58: \nL59: 2025年12月9日 · 1 分钟\nL60: \nL61: ## 欢迎在 LMArena 上测试 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120！\nL62: \nL63: ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120 现已在 LMArena 视觉排行榜上位列国内第 1 名。\nL64: \nL65: 2025年11月21日 · 1 分钟\nL66: \nL67: cite4†下一页 2/2 » Copyright © 2025 Baidu, Inc. All Rights Reserved.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMiniMax Research - Tech Insights & Product Updates | MiniMax (https://www.minimax.io/blog)\nciteturn1937view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.minimax.io/blog\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 76\nL0: Models\nL1: \nL2: cite0†Image: LLM LLM\nL3: \nL4: cite1†MiniMax M3 cite2†MiniMax M2.7 cite3†MiniMax M2.5 L5: \nL6: cite4†Image: VIDEO VIDEO\nL7: \nL8: cite5†MiniMax H3 L9: \nL10: cite6†Image: SPEECH & MUSIC SPEECH & MUSIC\nL11: \nL12: cite7†MiniMax Speech 2.8 cite8†MiniMax Music 3.0 L13: \nL14: Product\nL15: \nL16: cite9†MiniMax Code†code.minimax.io cite10†MiniMax Design†design.minimax.io cite11†Audio cite12†Talkie†www.talkie-ai.com L17: \nL18: API\nL19: \nL20: Plan\nL21: \nL22: Research\nL23: \nL24: Company\nL25: \nL26: cite13†Image: Intelligence with everyone Intelligence with everyone\nL27: \nL28: cite14†About cite15†News cite16†Investor Relations†ir.minimax.io L29: \nL30: cite17†Contact Us†platform.minimax.io L31: [Input]\nL32: \nL33: Models\nL34: \nL35: cite